  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Nobellah's Retreat<br>Seaside Beach Community<br>Pensacola St Seaside, FL 32459<br><br>Home Highlights:<br>~ 4 bedrooms (see room configurations by selecting “Room Details” tab above)<br>~ 3 full baths<br>~ Sleeps 10 guests<br>~ Two minute walk to the private beach access<br>~ Spacious front porch<br>~ Outdoor Shower<br>~ Built-in charcoal grill <br>~ Parking for 2 vehicles in the driveway<br>~ Four 26\" Adult Bikes Included Seasonally (Bikes not included Dec-Feb; additional rentals available upon request)<br>~ Pet-Friendly Home (2 Dogs Max & 50 Pound Weight Limit Per Pet; Non-refundable Pet Fee of $250.00 per pet. All pets must be listed on the reservation at booking and approved by 30A Cottages). Dogs are not allowed on the furniture and must be crated when left alone. (2 crates are provided).<br>~ Seaside amenity fee is an additional charge<br>~ This home has a one bedroom carriage house that can be rented separately for an additional cost<br><br>Experience the timeless charm of Seaside at Nobellah's Retreat, a beautifully designed 4-bedroom, 3-bath coastal haven just moments from the beach and Seaside's celebrated restaurants. This inviting home welcomes you with a spacious, wraparound-style front porch—the perfect setting for slow mornings and breezy evenings.<br>Inside, soft natural light and classic cottage details create a warm, relaxing atmosphere. Two serene bedrooms are located on the main level, while the second-floor master suite offers privacy and comfort. The third-floor bunk room—designed exclusively for kids—adds a playful touch, complete with ladder access for a treehouse-style feel.<br>Pet-friendly and full of character, Nobellah's Retreat blends comfort, charm, and the beloved spirit of Seaside for a vacation experience you'll return to year after year.<br><br>First Floor:<br>• Two comfortable guest bedrooms each with an ensuite<br>• Inviting stocked kitchen with luxury appliances<br>• Open living and dining spaces perfect for gathering and making memories<br>Second Floor:<br>• A private master suite with its own bath complete with a shower and soaking tub<br>Third Floor:<br>• A fun bunk room designed for kids only, accessed by a ladder—an instant favorite for little adventurers<br><br>With accommodations for the whole family and pet-friendly conveniences, Nobellah's Retreat is the ideal place to make lasting 30A memories. Whether you're exploring Seaside's iconic pavilions, enjoying nearby dining, relaxing on the white-sand beach, or savoring sunsets on the porch, this home offers a true retreat in one of the most beloved communities on the coast. Let your Seaside tradition begin at Nobellah's Retreat.<br><br>Community Amenities (For an additional Fee)<br>~ Multiple Community Pools<br>~ Private Community Beach Access<br>~ Seaside Town Center with Multiple Shopping and Dining Options<br>~ Access to Tennis, Pickleball, Fitness Center, Volleyball, Playground, Shuffle Board<br><br>Reservation/Booking Policy<br>***The cancelation policy and terms of the 30A Cottages & Concierge Vacation Rental Agreement emailed to you at confirmation override any terms and policies from a third party booking site such as VRBO.com, HomeAway.com, or VacationRentals.com. We are not able to reimburse any additional service fees incurred for online bookings outside of our company website since these fees are charged by a third party. We do not offer 100% refund for cancelation at any time after the booking has been processed. A 5% cancelation fee will be charged to cover credit card and document processing for all cancelations.<br><br>~ NO SMOKING<br>~ Pets Allowed <br>~ PUBLISHED RATES DO NOT INCLUDE TAX AND FEES<br>~ 50% of the total cost is due at the time of booking<br>~ Balance of payment is due 60 days prior to the scheduled arrival date (Or in full at booking if arriving within 60 days)<br>~ Except for a 5% cancelation fee, the initial 50% payment is fully refundable if cancelations are given more than 60 days prior to the arrival date<br>~ Optional travel insurance plans are available to our guests; some restrictions and timelines apply. Ask for details when booking. Insurance must be purchased BEFORE the final payment or at the time the reservation is paid in full.<br>~ CHECK-IN BEGINS AT 4:00 P.M. (CST) & CHECK-OUT IS BY 10:00 A.M.<br>~ Tenant must be at least twenty-five (25) years of age and will be an occupant of the Premises during the entire Rental Period. Reservations shall not be made by or for any person under the age of twenty-five (25), and no key will be issued to anyone who is not twenty-five (25) years of age. (Please see contract at the time of booking for further information)",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sunshine, Seaside and Nobellah's Retreat/ Pet Friendly/ 4 Bikes"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
